PROBLEM STATEMENT
Train Coach Management Using Circular Linked List in C++
Develop a Train Coach Management System using a Circular Linked List in C++. The system
should allow users to add new coaches, remove existing coaches, display all coaches, and
search for a particular coach using its coach number or type. Each coach should be represented
as a node containing coach details and a pointer to the next coach. The last coach must point
back to the first coach, forming a circular linked list. The system should provide a menu-driven
interface to manage coach operations efficiently and demonstrate the practical application of
circular linked lists in train coach management.
